Increases Defense by [24, 29, 34, 37, 40 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns.  When you avoid a melee blow, you set the target up, increasing the chance of you landing a critical strike on them by [15%, 18%, 20%, 22%, 23% (TL1-5; CUN 100)] and reducing their saving throws by [15, 18, 20, 22, 23 (TL1-5; CUN 100)].

The effects will scale with your Cunning.
